        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Rockwood RM4755, AccenTek Grooved Stainless Steel Door Pull </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCrafted from premium stainless steel, the RM4755 AccenTek® Pull combines bold grooves with delicate parting lines for a modern, sophisticated look.  Combining strength with sophistication, this pull delivers lasting performance in residential and commercial settings alike.  Rockwood's AccenTek Pulls can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, 36 inch, or 48 inch lengths with satin or polished stainless steel finish.\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Rockwood AccenTek Grooved Stainless Steel Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid 304 Stainless Steel </li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RM4755-12:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<b> RM4755-24:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b> RM4755-36:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b> RM4755-48:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This stainless steel pull is made to order and it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
